factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says the wife was killed on Palladam road (பல்லடம் சாலையில்), but the article says the couple lived on Thattanthottam first street on Palladam road; the place is stated as the road itself, which is a loose match and the caption/slides add 'தட்டான்தோட்டம் 1வது வீதி' which is correct, but the reel_script's opening line 'பல்லடம் சாலையில்' is not exactly the article's location (street is Thattanthottam first street off Palladam road).
  The reel_script says 'குடும்பத்தினர் கரூர் பாட்டி வீட்டில் தங்கியுள்ளனர்' (family is staying at grandmother's house in Karur) without making clear that the three children are the ones staying there; the article says the children are staying there, so this is acceptable, but the sentence structure is ambiguous since 'குடும்பத்தினர்' could be read as including the wife, who was killed.
  The reel_script states the husband 'குடித்து வீட்டுக்கு வந்தார்' (came home drunk) and the article says he 'குடித்து விட்டு வந்து' — consistent; however the reel_script omits the article's detail that the husband has a drinking habit (குடிப்பழக்கம் உள்ளவர்), which is minor.
  The caption and reel_script describe the husband as 'சுமை தூக்கும் தொழிலாளி' — consistent with article; no issue there.
  The reel_script and caption state the police 'உடலை கைப்பற்றி விசாரிக்கிறது' based on neighbours' information; the article says 'அக்கம் பக்கத்தினர் அளித்த தகவலின்படி' — consistent.
